title: The Factory Gates
subtitle: Most workers are still going in to work.
view-if: crisis_march = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.e21_gates_vote = (Q.worker_support >= 25) ? 60 : 30;
Q.e21_gates_vote = Math.round(Q.e21_gates_vote * Math.max(0.3, 1 - 0.15 * Q.e21_ma_rift));
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Out on strike: about ' + Math.round(Q.e21_ma_out / 10) * 10 + ',000 of the ' + Q.e21_ma_need + ',000 it takes';
Q.crisis_line_2 = ['Leuna: occupied by its workers', 'Leuna: held against the police', 'Leuna: stormed on 29 March', 'Leuna: given up without a fight'][Q.e21_leuna];
Q.crisis_line_3 = (Q.e21_ma_rift >= 5) ? 'At the gates: the other workers have turned on us' : ((Q.e21_ma_rift >= 3) ? 'At the gates: worker against worker' : (Q.e21_ma_rift ? 'At the gates: some fights with the men at work' : 'At the gates: no fights yet'));
!}
frequency: 100
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: crisis

= The Factory Gates

Outside Central Germany the morning shifts are going in as usual. In several towns our comrades ask the Zentrale for leave to close the gates themselves, with the unemployed, by force if need be. [? if e21_ma_rift >= 3 : After the fights of the last days, the men inside are in no mood to listen to us. ?]

- @unemployed: Send the unemployed to close the gates.
- @meetings: Put the strike to the vote in every works.
- @strike_pay: Pay strike money to those who come out.

@unemployed
subtitle: Many works will close. The men who are turned back will hate us for it.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_ma_out += 60;
Q.e21_ma_rift += 2;
RG.target('militancy');
Q.e21_gates_name = Q.sys_target_name;
RG.district(Q.sys_target, {loyalty: -5, repression: 6});
RG.startStrike(Q.sys_target, true);
RG.news('Strikers and workers fight at the factory gates in ' + Q.sys_target_name, 2);
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Out on strike: about ' + Math.round(Q.e21_ma_out / 10) * 10 + ',000 of the ' + Q.e21_ma_need + ',000 it takes';
Q.crisis_line_2 = ['Leuna: occupied by its workers', 'Leuna: held against the police', 'Leuna: stormed on 29 March', 'Leuna: given up without a fight'][Q.e21_leuna];
Q.crisis_line_3 = (Q.e21_ma_rift >= 5) ? 'At the gates: the other workers have turned on us' : ((Q.e21_ma_rift >= 3) ? 'At the gates: worker against worker' : (Q.e21_ma_rift ? 'At the gates: some fights with the men at work' : 'At the gates: no fights yet'));
!}

Columns of unemployed men march to the gates at dawn. At some works they turn the shift back. At others the workers fight them with iron bars, and the photographs from [+ e21_gates_name +] are in every paper by noon.

@meetings
subtitle: [? if lock_councils = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Slower, and it only works where the workers still trust us.
choose-if: lock_councils < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids council action.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_councils == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.e21_ma_out += Q.e21_gates_vote;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Out on strike: about ' + Math.round(Q.e21_ma_out / 10) * 10 + ',000 of the ' + Q.e21_ma_need + ',000 it takes';
Q.crisis_line_2 = ['Leuna: occupied by its workers', 'Leuna: held against the police', 'Leuna: stormed on 29 March', 'Leuna: given up without a fight'][Q.e21_leuna];
Q.crisis_line_3 = (Q.e21_ma_rift >= 5) ? 'At the gates: the other workers have turned on us' : ((Q.e21_ma_rift >= 3) ? 'At the gates: worker against worker' : (Q.e21_ma_rift ? 'At the gates: some fights with the men at work' : 'At the gates: no fights yet'));
!}

Our factory cells call mass meetings and put the strike to a vote. [? if e21_gates_vote >= 40 : Where the vote is won, the whole shift walks out together. ?][? if e21_gates_vote < 40 : Most of the votes are lost, and we accept it. ?]

@strike_pay
subtitle: Costs 1 fund.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The strike funds are empty.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.e21_ma_out += 35;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Out on strike: about ' + Math.round(Q.e21_ma_out / 10) * 10 + ',000 of the ' + Q.e21_ma_need + ',000 it takes';
Q.crisis_line_2 = ['Leuna: occupied by its workers', 'Leuna: held against the police', 'Leuna: stormed on 29 March', 'Leuna: given up without a fight'][Q.e21_leuna];
Q.crisis_line_3 = (Q.e21_ma_rift >= 5) ? 'At the gates: the other workers have turned on us' : ((Q.e21_ma_rift >= 3) ? 'At the gates: worker against worker' : (Q.e21_ma_rift ? 'At the gates: some fights with the men at work' : 'At the gates: no fights yet'));
!}

The strike funds are opened. A man who knows his family will eat can stay out another week.
